            title: `My First Angel Cheque`,
            subtitle: `A former colleague asks you for EUR 50,000 for his startup, and you have never invested in an unlisted company. Over fifteen months you decide how much of your savings you can put at risk, in how many companies, with what diligence, at what price and on what paper, what you do when one company takes off and another fades, and what you tell the tax office.`,
